  "sn45.39:1.2": "vo bhikkhave desissāmi || brahmacariyaphalāni ca || ",
  "sn45.39:1.3": "taṃ suṇātha || || 4. ",
  "sn45.39:1.4": "Katamañ ca bhikkhave brahmacariyaṃ || ",
  "sn45.39:1.5": "ayam eva ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo || seyyathīdaṃ || ",
  "sn45.39:1.6": "sammādiṭṭhi || pa || sammāsamādhi || || ",
  "sn45.39:1.7": "Idaṃ vuccati bhikkhave brahmacariyaṃ || || 5. ",
  "sn45.39:1.8": "Katamāni ca bhikkhave brahmacariyaphalāni || || ",
  "sn45.39:1.9": "Sotāpattiphalaṃ sakadāgāmiphalaṃ anāgāmiphalam arahattaphalaṃ || || ",
  "sn45.39:1.10": "Imāni vuccanti bhikkhave brahmacariyaphalānīti || || 1.2. ",
  "sn45.39:1.11": "Sāvatthi || || 3. Brahmacariyaṃ ca "
